  "description": "Certificate of Lawful Development Existing: Change of use from a C3 single dwelling house to a C4 HMO for up to 6 occupants",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height:17.0pt&quot;&gt;The existing use of the dwellinghouse comprises 6 self contained units which does not fall within the definition of a &#x27;house in multiple occupation&#x27; (use class C4) and accordingly&amp;nbsp;is not within the tolerances of Class L of Part 3, Schedule 2 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended). The development is therefore unlawful.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
